      "content": "i get that, i know what the textbooks say... but it feels way too consistent to be just random glitches. like, it's almost always right when i'm hitting a breaking point. it's making me really anxious that i'm actually doing this to the equipment without meaning to. do you think there's any way i can learn to stabilize my energy or something so i don't keep causing these disruptions around people? i just want to feel more in control of it.",
